        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Harvey Pekar, Denise Levertov, Joyce Brabner\n- Roles: comic book writer, music critic, media personality, poet, political comics writer, widow\n- Works: American Splendor\n\nFacts:\n- Denise Levertov was born on October 24, 1923, and was an American poet.\n- Harvey Pekar was born on October 8, 1939, and was an American underground comic book writer, music critic, and media personality.\n- Joyce Brabner was born on March 1, 1952, and is a writer of political comics.\n- Harvey Pekar was best known for his autobiographical comic series \"American Splendor.\"\n- Joyce Brabner is the widow of Harvey Pekar.\n- Denise Levertov died on December 20, 1997.\n- Harvey Pekar died on July 12, 2010.",
